  "title": "Home and household",
  "note": "Location uses w (in) or na (on, at) + the locative case. Typical forms: w domu, w pokoju (-u); w kuchni, w sypialni (-i); na stole, w szafie (-e). Before -e some consonants change: stół → na stole, ogród → w ogrodzie, łazienka → w łazience, lodówka → w lodówce.",
